'''Frost Crabs''' are [[aggressive]] monsters that look like harmless ice blocks while disguised, but attack when walked by. They are found within the [[Ruins of Tapoyauik]] in [[Varlamore]].

Like other [[Crab (disambiguation)|crabs]], they are popular for low intensity combat training due to their high hitpoints and low damage output. 

